        <activityName xml:lang="en">Thermal insulation, 100mm, 40kg/m3, alumium cladding, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Thermal insulation, 100mm, 40kg/m3, alumium cladding, at plant
Production of a thermal insulation of ventilation duct, made of 40 kg/m3 rock wool, insulation thickness 100 mm, total weight: 6.6 kg/m2. Including cover with 0.8 mm aluminium cladding. Reference value of inventory is m2 area of duct surface.;
UUID: e1600206-442c-3156-a6a4-3b6ba1f24a8d
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for ventilation systems in commercial and public buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Process information from 2003 to 2012
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e1600206-442c-3156-a6a4-3b6ba1f24a8d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
